{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-05_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-05","title":"高空坠物","storyCode":"2-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"498eec1bceed04f060a94922f54597e94b35d513cbb8a0614ebd611a3134069f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一行带着米莎撤退，而名为碎骨的整合运动首领没有追赶。\n另一边，能天使让众人往楼顶集合，她选择的路线竟然是......","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十七关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎小姐！请跟上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么......会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"这边，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"区域clear！小心敌方追击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"他们也是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他们确实是......感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么感染者之间要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你放他们逃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"他们逃不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我找到她了——不，不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......等到她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"——你认真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"标记是这么写的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"可这......这是向上啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"纵向移动，真的会有用吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"阿米娅，阿米娅！上来，对对，就是上面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——能天使！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你......确定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"相信我，不会有错的~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"龙门的路，我实在是太熟啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"爬楼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"这岂不是......等着敌人来包围我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"快点，要是被整合运动发现就真的难说了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，等等，你们先进去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我会焊死入口处的大门，堵住整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这里楼梯的墙上，有一个企鹅的标记，是这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，前方左转，沿着楼梯向上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"进入建筑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不是要从地下走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不是不是，刚才就说了，往上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......往上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我们真的......可以相信她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"企鹅物流的宗旨之一是，只要能抵达目的地，什么路都可以走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"先试一次我们的服务吧。你会喜欢上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎，对不起......我也没想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是罗德岛的那位Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来你不太喜欢爬楼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["碎骨"]}]}
